# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# .gitignore RACINE — filet de sécurité
# Chaque sous-projet a son propre .gitignore plus complet.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Secrets (jamais, au grand jamais)
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
**/secrets.json
**/*.pem
**/*.key

# Dépendances
**/node_modules/
**/.pnp/
**/.yarn/*
!**/.yarn/patches
!**/.yarn/plugins
!**/.yarn/releases
!**/.yarn/versions

# Builds
**/.next/
**/out/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/.turbo/

# OS / éditeurs
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
.idea/
.vscode/settings.json
*.sublime-*

# Logs
**/*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# Uploads Directus locaux
cms/uploads/
cms/snapshots/*.generated.yaml

# Python (si ETL ajouté)
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/venv/
**/.venv/

# Tests / coverage
**/coverage/
**/.nyc_output/

# Vercel
**/.vercel/

# TypeScript
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/next-env.d.ts

# Claude Code session metadata (non committé)
.claude/

# Temporaire
*.tmp
*.bak
*~
